  "item_short_desc": "<p>Discover comfort and style with our Womens Essential Moisture Wicking Tank Top. As part of Rothco&rsquo;s Women&rsquo;s Essential Collection, the tank top is crafted for everyday style and endless comfort while providing all-day versatility and functionality ideal for any wardrobe.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": null,
  "description": "<p>Discover comfort and style with our Womens Essential Moisture Wicking Tank Top. As part of Rothco&rsquo;s Women&rsquo;s Essential Collection, the tank top is crafted for everyday style and endless comfort while providing all-day versatility and functionality ideal for any wardrobe. Quick Dry Performance Fabric: Made from a soft moisture wicking material, the womens tank top keeps you cool and dry during high-intensity workouts and hot weather. For added comfort, the performance tank features flat seams at the collar and bottom hem, as well as a tag-less neck label. Comfortable and Easygoing: Designed with a crew neck, tapered waist, and curved hem, this sleeveless top sits just right, and is great for layering or as a standalone top. Versatile Everyday Tee: From an active lifestyle consisting of working out, hiking, jogging, or going to the beach, to casual outings, family gatherings, or vacations, these comfortable tank tops complement a variety of styles. Complete the Look: Our Womens Essential Moisture Wicking Tank Top goes especially well with a pair of our Womens Vintage Paratrooper Fatigue Pants or BDU Cargo Pants.</p>",
